    "title": "How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders: Streaming and TV by country",
    "text": "2026 Tour of Flanders start and finish timeThe 2026 Tour of Flanders edition takes place on Sunday, April 5, with the race starting at 10:20 CET and approximately finishing around 16:20 CET.2026 Tour of Flanders live on DomestiqueFollow all the action via our live report!How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in the UK?TNT Sports and HBO Max are where you can find the action for the Tour of Flanders in the UK.For TNT Sports subscribers, you can find the action on one of the designated channels or by pressing the red button.HBO Max serves as the streaming platform for online viewers in the UK, with a current plan available at £30.99 a month.How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in North-America?For both viewers in Canada and the US, the race will be shown live on FloBikes, with a monthly subscription costing $39.99 a month or $203.88 for a 12-month plan.How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in Europe?European viewers can access live coverage of the Tour of Flanders by checking their local broadcaster in the list below, or via Eurosport, available on Discovery+ or HBO Max, depending on their country.How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in Australia?In Australia, the race is available on SBS and FloBikes.How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in South America?In Latin America, you can watch the race on ESPN.How to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in Asia?In Asia, you can watch the race on MAX/Discovery+ & Eurosport 1 InternationalHow to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders in Africa?In Africa, the race is available on SuperSport.2026 Tour of Flanders broadcastersHow to watch the 2026 Tour of Flanders while abroad (with a VPN)?Most streaming platforms are geo-restricted, meaning access depends on your location. If the 2026 Tour of Flanders isn’t available in your country, you can use a VPN (Virtual Private Network) to change your virtual location and access the services you normally use at home. Availability may still vary depending on local broadcasting rights.We’ve got two great deals for you, and by claiming them, you help us keep our content free.👉 ExpressVPN:Get 61% off a 2-year plan, plus 4 extra months free.👉 Surfshark: Save up to 87% on your first 27 months of VPN.",
